        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>If <computeroutput>q_storage</computeroutput> is NULL and <computeroutput>q_len</computeroutput> is 0, the queue will have no ring buffer and can only hold one event at a time in <computeroutput>front_e</computeroutput>.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="inout">me</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pointer to the event queue instance. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">q_storage</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pointer to the ring buffer storage (can be NULL if <computeroutput>q_len</computeroutput> is 0). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">q_len</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Length of the ring buffer (can be 0 if <computeroutput>q_storage</computeroutput> is NULL). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
